  "ruleText": "Fors 302.06 Additional References. The OPLC shall require of the applicant the names and addresses of additional references if the original information provided by the references is unclear, incomplete, or contradictory.\n\nSource. #6876, eff 10-28-98; ss by #8710, eff 8-25-06; ss by #10544, eff 3-13-14; ss by #14085, eff 11-24-24",
